#: KfiCmModule.cpp:140
msgid ""
"<h1>Font Installer</h1>"
"<p> This module allows you to install TrueType, Type1, Speedo, and Bitmap "
"fonts. If you have StarOffice installed on your system, this can also be "
"configured.</p>"
"<p>This module has 2 main modes of operation:"
"<ul>"
"<li><i>Basic:</i> The underlying folder structure is hidden, and you will only "
"be able to install/uninstall TrueType and Type1 fonts.</li>"
"<li><i>Advanced:</i> This is for more experienced users, and displays the X "
"fonts folder structure - allowing you to add/delete whole folders to/from the X "
"font path. Using this mode you can also install/uninstall Speedo and Bitmap "
"(pcf, bdf, and snf) fonts.</li></ol>"
msgstr ""
"<h1>Schriftoorden installeern</h1> "
"<p> Mit dütt Moduul kannst Du TrueType-, Type1-, Speedo- und "
"Bitmap-Schriftoorden installeern. Wenn Du StarOffice op Dien Systeem hest, "
"kannst Du dorför hier ok Schriftoorden instellen.</p>"
"<p>Dat Moduul hett 2 Bedriefsoorden:"
"<ul>"
"<li><i>Normaal:</i> De Struktuur vun de Orner blifft versteken, un Du kannst "
"bloots TrueType- un Type1-Schriftoorden installeern oder wegdoon."
"<li> "
"<li><i>Verwiedert:</i> Dat is för Brukers mit mehr Künn, un wiest de Struktuur "
"vun den X-Schriftoorden-Orner. Du kannst heele Orner to den X-Schriftoorden- "
"Padd tofögen oder vun em wegdoon. In düsse Bedriefsoort kannst Du ok Speedo- un "
"Bitmap-Schriftoorden (pcf, bdf un snf) tofögen/wegdoon."
"<li></ul>"

#: KfiCmModule.cpp:151
msgid ""
"<p><b>NOTE:</b> As you are not logged in as \"root\", any fonts installed will "
"only be available to you. To install fonts system wide, use the \"Administrator "
"Mode\" button to run this module as \"root\".</p>"
msgstr ""
"<p><b>Bemark bitte:</b>Wenn Du nich as \"root\" anmellt büst, warrt all "
"installerte Schriftoorden bloots för Di verfögbaar ween. Bruk den "
"\"Administrator-Bedrief\"-Knopp un föhr dat Moduul as \"root\" ut, üm "
"Schriftoorden systeemwiet to installeern.</p>"

